<title>USA: Amex says short interest rises by 6.2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Amex says short interest rises by 6.2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Stock Exchange said Thursday short interest as of Sept 13 rose 6.2 million shares to 125,100,219 shares.</p>
<p>This was also an increase from the mid-August total of 118,939,324 shares.</p>
